recommend keep-going the stereo dynamics family grows from here; the next crux is ALES49's limiter carried into stereo (stereo_limit) — the brickwall as the ratio->infinity corner of this rung's linked gain (seat the linked key at the ceiling, scale both channels by ceiling/key), already foreshadowed by the seat-at-threshold knob law — agent-doable, no gate reached, witness GREEN, TAME clean.
